        "original_id": "288f5f8d-b6d9-5e5a-80db-d7131462fa4e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Holger Danske, Ogier the Dane\n- Works: medieval chansons de geste, Geste de Doon de Mayence\n- Topics: legendary characters, disambiguation\n\nFacts:\n- Holger Danske, also called Ogier the Dane, is a legendary character appearing in medieval chansons de geste.\n- Ogier the Dane is the French and English name for the legendary character called Holger Danske in Danish.\n- Ogier the Dane first appears in an Old French chanson de geste within the poem cycle Geste de Doon de Mayence.",
